        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "SI",
        "iso_639_1": "sl",
        "name": "Slovenščina",
        "english_name": "Slovenian",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Leta 1897 se Amelija Križevska-Zeg po medenih tednih vrne na družinsko posestvo v Lembergu (današnji Lvov), kjer je odrasla. Je polna upanja za prihodnost in sanja o odprtju lastne lekarne. Toda postopoma se njen otroški dom spremeni v nevarno past, Amelijini načrti pa postanejo neizpolnjene želje. Film temelji na resničnih dogodkih.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "Vsi odtenki skušnjave"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "BR",
        "iso_639_1": "pt",
        "name": "Português",
        "english_name": "Portuguese",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Em Lemberg (Lviv), em 1897, Amelia Kryzhevska-Zeg retorna à propriedade da família onde cresceu após sua lua de mel. Ela está cheia de esperança para o futuro e sonha em abrir sua própria farmácia. Mas, gradualmente, sua casa de infância se transforma em uma armadilha traiçoeira, e os planos de Amelia se tornam desejos impossíveis de realizar.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "All Shades of Temptation"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "CN",
        "iso_639_1": "zh",
        "name": "普通话",
        "english_name": "Mandarin",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "1897年，新婚的阿米莉亚·克日热夫斯卡-泽回到利沃夫的家族庄园，这里是她长大的地方。她对未来充满憧憬，计划开设一间属于自己的药房，实现经济独立。但随着日子推移，这座充满童年回忆的老宅，逐渐露出了危险的一面，变成一座步步惊心的陷阱，阿米莉亚的人生规划与独立梦想，在家族的暗流中，一点点沦为无法实现的泡影。",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "诱惑的阴影"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "NL",
        "iso_639_1": "nl",
        "name": "Nederlands",
        "english_name": "Dutch",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "In 1897 keert Amelia Kryzhevska-Zeg in Lemberg (Lviv) na haar huwelijksreis terug naar het ouderlijk huis waar ze is opgegroeid. Ze is vol hoop voor de toekomst en droomt ervan een eigen apotheek te openen. Maar geleidelijk aan verandert haar ouderlijk huis in een verraderlijke val en worden Amelia's plannen onvervulbare verlangens.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      }
